 <h3><u>Teri Kya baat hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Teri kya baat hai-4<br> Sun ke ZAINAB ke khutbaat darbar me bole SHAH E ZAMAN<br> teri kya baat hai-2</p> 
  <p>Laaj rakhli hai tune bade Bhai ki,<br> Meri choti behen, Teri kya baat hai.<br> Sun ke ZAINAB ke khutbaat.<br> 1) Theek se koi leta na naam e KHUDA,<br> gar na hoti bapa deher me Karbala,<br> Aur zinda rakhi tune woh Karbala,<br> Bint e khaibar shikan Teri kya baat hai.<br> Sun ke ZAINAB ke khutbaat.</p> 
  <p>2) Ghair ke zikr par tilmilata hai tu,<br> Zikr E HAIDER pe bas muskurata hai tu,<br> Dhyan rakhta hai tu mere jazbat ka,<br> Mere Maulai man Teri kya baat hai.<br> Sun ke ZAINAB ke khutbaat.</p> 
  <p>3) Aasmano se utri hai meri tarha,<br> Teri khilqat bhi noori hai meri tarha,<br> FATEMA-3 ne kaha zulfiqar e ALI<br> Meri choti behen Teri kya baat hai<br> Sun ke ZAINAB ke khutbaat.</p> 
  <p>4) Tujhko aakar salami sitare ne Di,<br> Teri jaisi kisi ki na shadi hui,<br> Aqd tera KHUDA ne padha arsh par<br> MURTUZA ki dulhan Teri kya baat hai.</p> 
  <p>5) (yun bhi mehboob rakhte hain tujhko NABI,<br> tune pehli gawahi wilayat ki di,)-2<br> Tujhko hasil hai heero'n pe youn bartari,<br> Ay aqeeq E Yemen Teri kya baat hai<br> Sun ke ZAINAB ke khutbaat.</p> 
  <p>6) (apne shauhar ko Marne se roka nahi,<br> kis tarha se jiyungi ye socha nahi,)-2<br> Teri himmat tere hausle ko salaam,<br> Ay wahab ki dulhan Teri kya baat hai.<br> Sun ke ZAINAB ke khutbaat.</p> 
  <p>7) (aisa be lafz ASGHAR ne khutbaa dia,<br> Jiski haibat se maida'n larazne laha)-2<br> Mir Sajjad KHALIQ ki aayi sada,<br> Ay KHUDA e sukhan Teri kya baat hai.<br> Teri kya baat hai.</p> 
